      "Sucralose, acesulfame potassium and carrageenan",
      "Biggest, highest-calorie scoop here",
      "Amazon price swings; it was $75.35 in an earlier check"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The most protein for the money, if you can live without a certification logo.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "30 g per 46 g scoop",
      "Calories": "160",
      "Third-party testing": "None found",
      "Cost per 25 g": "About $1.16 (Amazon price seen, $55.67)"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008JC26E4"
  },
  {
