    "brand": "Thorne",
    "badge": "Best for Tested Athletes",
    "category": "Whey isolate",
    "description": "Thorne's chocolate isolate gives 21 g of protein, 100 calories, 4 g of carbohydrate and 2 g of sugar in a 30.2 g scoop, per the label at the time of writing. It is sweetened with a little cane sugar and stevia (rebaudioside A), uses alkalized cocoa, and adds bromelain and papain. It is NSF Certified for Sport, per Thorne and the NSF registry. At $65 for 30 servings on Amazon, it is about $2.58 per 25 g, the priciest card here.",
